# A second look of the moor (a texture variant): forked from it; the same ground laid again, the
# tufts with the moor's edges=2 (so the tufts across its edges are the moor's, and the looks join)
# and their own seed inside; the heather elsewhere.
fork moor moor_b
variant of=moor
noise ramp=moor weights=0,2,8,2,0 density=0.25 seed=109
tufts ramp=moor0,moor1,moor3,moor4 edges=2 seed=5
paint 8,30 <<
  .c..d.
  ccdcc.
  cbcdcc
  .bbcb.
>>
